# AI Assistant Guidelines & Mandatory Rules

## MANDATORY RULE: Mobile Layout 100% Preservation
- The mobile version for `@repo/2026-thenamduhillresort` was completed first and is fully locked.
- During any desktop layout refactoring (based on Figma / `3-desktop.png`), Mobile layout MUST NOT BE ALTERED OR BROKEN.
- For any complex layout changes, use DOM separation:
  - Mobile wrapper: `<div className="block md:hidden">`
  - Desktop wrapper: `<div className="hidden md:block">`
- Never modify non-prefixed Tailwind classes that dictate mobile styles unless explicitly fixing a mobile bug.
